         ${misc:Depends}
Description: weather in the FlickOS panel
 The temperature and the sky now in the FlickOS panel, and the next hours
 and days when you point at it, for a town or city you pick. The forecast
 comes from Open-Meteo.com, which is sent only the place's position, rounded
 to about 1 km, once an hour.
 .
 Off by default: turned on in Settings > Weather, and nothing of it runs or
 is sent while off.
